SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n**🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability a
 nd weather. If you make plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or ad
 just our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fu
 lly responsible for your own health and safety. Each person is responsible
  to take a break for rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316358091/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260831T181402Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T181402Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316624168@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045343Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T110000
SUMMARY:Indoor | Girls’ Morning Out: Pickleball + Yoga in Bridgewater\, 
 NJ
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nMake plans 
 with a friend for a morning of yoga\, pickleball\, and giving back.\n\nJoi
 n us at Pickle + Flow: start with guided yoga led by Sana Yoga\, then lear
 n pickleball and play friendly games with other women. Enjoy time outdoors
 \, try something new\, and support our campaign to raise $5\,000 for Safe+
 Sound Somerset.\nCome with your sister\, mother\, adult daughter\, coworke
 r\, or friend—or join us on your own. Women ages 18+ are welcome.\n\nBRI
 NG A FRIEND: TWO TICKETS FOR THE PRICE OF ONE\nFor a limited time\, purcha
 se two tickets together for the price of one. Both of you can enjoy guided
  yoga\, beginner pickleball coaching\, and equipment provided.\n[View tick
 et options and book on Eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1997969022
 129?aff=oddtdtcreator)\n\nComing solo? You’re welcome to purchase an ind
 ividual ticket and join us.\n\n**WHAT YOU’LL GET FROM THE MORNING**\n•
  Guided yoga with Sana Yoga\, with modifications for different experience 
 levels.\n• Pickleball instruction covering how to hold the paddle\, scor
 e\, and play.\n• Paddles and balls provided—no need to buy equipment.\
 n• Friendly games and time to meet other women.\n• Coffee\, event give
 aways\, and photo opportunities.\n• A morning to spend with someone you 
 care about while supporting a community fundraiser.\nNo yoga or pickleball
  experience is needed. We’ll help you get started.\n\n**YOUR MORNING**\n
 9:00 AM — Arrive\, enjoy coffee\, and meet the group.\n9:15 AM — Guide
 d yoga flow with Sana Yoga.\n10:00 AM — Beginner pickleball instruction 
 and friendly games.\n10:45 AM — Giveaways\, photos\, and time to connect
 .\n\n**GIVING BACK TO OUR COMMUNITY**\nOur fundraising goal is $5\,000 for
  Safe+Sound Somerset\, which supports survivors of domestic and sexual vio
 lence and their families.\n\nCan’t attend? You can still [make a donatio
 n](https://runsignup.com/TicketEvent/P3Thryve/Donate) or share this event 
 with someone who would enjoy it.\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\nComfortable athleti
 c clothes\, sneakers with good grip\, water\, and a yoga mat if you have o
 ne. A limited number of loaner mats will be available. Activities take pla
 ce outdoors\, so dress for the weather.\nFree on-site parking and restroom
 s are available.\n\n**RESERVE YOUR SPOT**\nA Meetup RSVP does not reserve 
 admission. Please purchase your ticket through Eventbrite.\n[Book your mor
 ning out—or bring a friend with the two-for-one offer](https://www.event
 brite.com/e/1997969022129?aff=oddtdtcreator)\n\n**IMPORTANT INFORMATION**\
 nAll ticket sales are final and nonrefundable. You may transfer your ticke
 t to another woman. Participation is voluntary\; follow safety guidance an
 d move within your comfort level. Photos and videos may be taken for promo
 tional purposes. Please notify the organizer at check-in if you prefer not
  to be photographed.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316624168/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260919T140920Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260919T140920Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
