X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316624204@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045343Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T200000
SUMMARY:Indoor | Pickleball & Bachata Social — Meet People- Singles\, Co
 uples\, Friends
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n**Picklebal
 l & Bachata Social — Meet New People in Watchung\, NJ**\nMake your Satur
 day night about meeting people\, trying something new\, and having fun—w
 ith pickleball\, bachata\, gift baskets\, and a Luzz pickleball paddle giv
 eaway!\n\nCome solo or bring friends. Meet other singles in a relaxed sett
 ing where a game or dance lesson gives you a natural way to start a conver
 sation. Couples and partners are welcome too—this community social is op
 en to everyone ages 18+.\n\n**Saturday\\\, September 26 \\| 5–9 PM**\nPi
 ckleball Kingdom Watchung\n\n**WHAT TO EXPECT**\n• 5–6 PM: Arrive\, mi
 ngle\, explore the vendors\, and start meeting people.\n• 6 PM: Join the
  beginner bachata class. No experience or partner needed.\n• Enjoy begin
 ner-friendly pickleball\, dancing\, and time to chat during the evening.\n
 • Browse the gift baskets available for auction and take part in event g
 iveaways—including a Luzz pickleball paddle giveaway.\n\n**WHY JOIN US?*
 *\n• Try pickleball and bachata in one evening.\n• Meet singles and ex
 pand your social circle through shared activities.\n• Come on your own w
 ithout needing to bring a playing or dance partner.\n• Explore local ven
 dors and discover businesses in your community.\n• Get a chance to win a
  Luzz pickleball paddle and bid on gift baskets.\n• Enjoy a night out wh
 ile supporting a community fundraiser.\nGift baskets are available through
  the auction\; winning a basket or giveaway is not guaranteed with admissi
 on.\n\n**PLAY FOR A PURPOSE**\nWe’re working toward raising $5\,000 for 
 Safe+Sound Somerset. Your participation helps support our community fundra
 ising effort.\n\n**RESERVE YOUR SPOT**\nA Meetup RSVP alone does not reser
 ve admission. Purchase your ticket and see current pricing here:\n[https:/
 /www.eventbrite.com/e/central-jersey-pickleball-bachata-community-social-t
 ickets-1998242925381](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/central-jersey-pickleba
 ll-bachata-community-social-tickets-1998242925381)\nWear comfortable cloth
 es and sneakers\, bring water\, and come ready to play\, dance\, and meet 
 people.\n\n**Important Policies**\n**Weather & Rain Date Policy:** This ev
 ent may be postponed or rescheduled due to rain\, severe weather\, unsafe 
 conditions\, or circumstances beyond the organizers’ control. If the eve
 nt is postponed\, all tickets will automatically transfer to the announced
  rain date or rescheduled date. Refunds will not be issued if a ticket hol
 der is unable to attend the new date. If the event is canceled by the orga
 nizers and no replacement date is scheduled\, attendees will be contacted 
 regarding available options.\n**Liability and Assumption of Risk:** Partic
 ipation is voluntary. Neither Yes We Thryve\, NJ Singles\, Catholic Single
 s NJ\, nor their organizers\, volunteers\, instructors\, venues\, or hosts
  shall be responsible for any injury\, illness\, loss\, theft\, or propert
 y damage occurring during or in connection with the event\, to the fullest
  extent permitted by law.\n**Photography and Consent:** Photos and videos 
 may be taken during the event for marketing\, promotional\, and community 
 purposes. By attending\, you consent to the use of your image in future pr
 omotions. Please notify an organizer at the event if you prefer not to be 
 photographed or recorded.\n**Email Subscription:** By RSVPing\, you agree 
 to be added to the Yes We Thryve and NJ Singles email lists for event anno
 uncements and community updates. You may unsubscribe at any time.\n**Respe
 ct and Courtesy:** Please be kind and respectful toward venue staff\, orga
 nizers\, volunteers\, and fellow guests. Disruptive\, threatening\, discri
 minatory\, or inappropriate behavior may result in removal from the event 
 without a refund.\n**Arrival and Departure:** You are welcome to arrive la
 te or leave early unless the event description states otherwise. This is i
 ntended to be a friendly\, inclusive\, and low-pressure environment where 
 guests can connect in person.\n**Ticket Policy:** All sales are final. Tic
 kets are nonrefundable and non-transferable\, except where otherwise state
 d by the organizers.
